  "Tutorial Start",
  "In this stage,",
  "unlike the previous one,",
  "you will be commanding",
  "multiple teams.",
  "In the first stage,",
  "with no detailed explanation,",
  "you had to command",
  "multiple teams,",
  "which may have confused you,",
  "so in this stage, I would like",
  "to explain it in detail.",
  "First,",
  "please look here.",
  "As the number at the base",
  "of the symbol indicates,",
  "there are 3 teams",
  "in this area.",
  "The same goes for the enemy:",
  "in this area,",
  "2 of its teams",
  "are present.",
  "Note that when several teams",
  "share the same area",
  "and a battle breaks out there,",
  "the teams in that area fight",
  "in order, starting with",
  "the lowest strength value.",
  "Now, when several teams",
  "share the same area,",
  "before the team menu",
  "can be displayed,",
  "you must first select a team.",
  "Selecting a symbol displays",
  "the team's name here,",
  "with left and right arrows.",
  "In this state, press left",
  "or right on the +Control Pad,",
  "or touch the arrows,",
  "to select a team.",
  "Confirm your choice,",
  "and the team menu will open.",
  "This much, I believe,",
  "I explained earlier.",
  "Now I would like to explain",
  "the team menu's",
  "'Organize' command,",
  "which I set aside earlier.",
  "'Organize' is a feature",
  "that lets you take several teams",
  "in the same area",
  "and rearrange them freely",
  "into entirely different,",
  "brand-new teams",
  "as you see fit.",
  "You might gather",
  "your strongest units in one team",
  "to create a team where each",
  "is a match for a thousand.",
  "Or you might spread your units",
  "evenly across all teams",
  "so that every team",
  "can hold its own in a fight.",
  "What kind of teams to build",
  "is entirely up to you.",
  "Doing it is simple.",
  "From the team menu,",
  "just select 'Organize'.",
  "As you can see,",
  "the screen splits in two,",
  "and the line-ups of the teams",
  "that shared the area",
  "are shown on the left",
  "and right sides respectively.",
  "Here you can move units",
  "as well as characters",
  "between the teams.",
  "Now, as an example,",
  "let's actually",
  "reorganize some teams.",
  "Let's take the",
  "Saberfish in Team B",
  "and move it",
  "into Team A.",
  "First, move the cursor",
  "to the Saberfish,",
  "the unit to be moved.",
  "Then press the A Button",
  "to confirm.",
  "Around the Saberfish,",
  "a rotating orange frame",
  "has appeared, as you should",
  "be able to see.",
  "Then, to where you want it...",
  "And with that,",
  "the Saberfish",
  "has finished moving",
  "to Team A.",
  "Note that to do the same",
  "with the stylus,",
  "touch the",
  "character or unit",
  "you want to move,",
  "then slide it",
  "to the destination,",
  "and it will move there.",
  "Note that when 3 or more teams",
  "share an area",
  "and you use 'Organize',",
  "you can hold the L Button",
  "and press left or right",
  "on the +Control Pad",
  "to switch the team on the left,",
  "or hold the R Button",
  "to switch the team",
  "on the right side",
  "of the screen.",
  "So now, the unit",
  "that was in Team B",
  "has moved to Team A,",
  "and though it's only one unit,",
  "Team A's strength",
  "has gone up.",
  "And since Team B",
  "now has no units",
  "left at all,",
  "it will disappear.",
  "If you press the B Button",
  "or touch the 'Back' button",
  "here,",
  "a confirmation message",
  "will be displayed.",
  "Once you select \"Confirm\"",
  "and press the A Button,",
  "the 'Organize' changes just made",
  "will be finalized.",
  "Once 'Organize' is finalized,",
  "you return to the normal map,",
  "and all the teams involved",
  "will count as having acted.",
  "If you instead select \"Discard\"",
  "and confirm, everything",
  "reverts to how it was before",
  "and you return to the normal map.",
  "In that case, the teams involved",
  "will not count as having acted.",
  "Now, 'Organize' is",
  "largely up to you, but",
  "there are a few points to watch,",
  "so let me list them here.",
  "First, you cannot form a team",
  "made up of characters alone.",
  "Every team needs",
  "at least 1 unit.",
  "Next, when you use 'Organize',",
  "the teams affected",
  "are all the teams",
  "that were in that same area.",
  "For example, suppose",
  "you use 'Organize' on",
  "Teams A, B and C.",
  "Even if you swap units",
  "between A and B",
  "and leave C's line-up",
  "entirely unchanged,",
  "once you confirm",
  "and exit this 'Organize',",
  "Teams A, B and C",
  "will all count as having acted.",
  "Conversely,",
  "if you enter the 'Organize' screen",
  "but change nothing at all",
  "and return to the map,",
  "or make changes but undo them",
  "and exit the 'Organize' screen...",
  "Also, 'Organize' can do more",
  "than merge teams into one.",
  "It can, of course, also",
  "split one team into several",
  "teams.",
  "When doing so,",
  "please bear in mind",
  "that you can only create",
  "up to 10 teams.",
  "If you already have 10 teams,",
  "you cannot use 'Organize'",
  "to create an 11th.",
  "When using 'Organize',",
  "you also need to mind",
  "the terrain where you are.",
  "In other words, you cannot form",
  "a team made up only of units",
  "that can't be placed there.",
  "Now, about 'Organize',",
  "there is just one more thing",
  "I need to explain.",
  "For now, each team",
  "holds only a few units, but",
  "as their numbers grow,",
  "this will become important.",
  "On this 'Organize' screen,",
  "press the X Button",
  "or the 'Info' button here,",
  "and the top screen shows",
  "the selected unit's details.",
  "Within this unit information,",
  "I would like you to focus on",
  "the value called [MOBILITY].",
  "This [MOBILITY] value",
  "expresses the unit's",
  "\"vulnerability\"",
  "as a number.",
  "For example,",
  "say a team of 5 units",
  "fights a battle",
  "and suffers 3 losses.",
  "The 3 units destroyed",
  "will be those with",
  "the lowest [MOBILITY],",
  "in that order.",
  "In other words, if a team",
  "has a high-performance unit",
  "you can't afford to lose,",
  "such as the Gundam,",
  "adding low-[MOBILITY] units",
  "to that team",
  "will raise the Gundam's",
  "chances of survival.",
  "Now, back to the matter at hand.",
  "Right now, Team A",
  "has the Gundam",
  "and 2 other units.",
  "Their [MOBILITY] value,",
  "as shown here,",
  "is \"3.\"",
  "The Gundam's [MOBILITY] value,",
  "on the other hand,",
  "is \"10.\"",
  "So in this team,",
  "if losses occur in battle,",
  "the Saberfish will be",
  "shot down first,",
  "in effect \"the Gundam's shield.\"",
  "That is how it works.",
  "This concludes",
  "the explanation of",
  "team 'Organize' and",
  "the [MOBILITY] value.",
  "The Saberfish",
  "I moved to Team A",
  "a moment ago",
  "will now go back to Team B.",
  "Now please try",
  "the 'Organize' feature",
